 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "acceptance US12 29b-1§5 The bone meal framework: bone meal item (5.3): a valid target shrinks the stack on the server whether or not the success test passes (V16), performs only on success;" TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM BEGIN-CASE
     MOVE "1 1 1 0 0" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "GB-BONEMEAL-ITEM" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-I5 WS-R1 WS-R2 WS-R3 WS-R4
     MOVE 4 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "1 0 1 0 0" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "GB-BONEMEAL-ITEM" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-I5 WS-R1 WS-R2 WS-R3 WS-R4
     MOVE 4 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "1 1 0 0 0" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
